Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:34:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] fix: package an isolated local desktop without upstream
 update collisions

Give the local fork a distinct bundle, profile and update source. Disable SDK-only pipe2 detection in bundled libevent to prevent terminal startup crashes on this macOS runtime. Packaging succeeds with the prepared Node 22 runtime; frontend regression has 680 passing files.
